      "proposed_content": "Moment order is an adjustable upper-tail lens. The full family of integer moment bounds can constrain pointwise growth; layer-cake integration balances moment weight against tail decay and localizes the value band carrying a fixed moment; and conjectural estimates uniform for growing order can be optimized toward maximal-order lower heuristics.",
